 - FUN_0000_a202 (0xa202): tests byte[di+0x19]&0x20 / &0x40 and runs a1e9 (flap-up) or a26d (flap-down)
   with DAT_2000_5602 temporarily set to the fast rate DAT_2000_5604.  byte[di+0x19] base-lost.
